@startuml 010-contract-seq-generate
title Contract Management - Auto-Generate via Outbox (FR-10)

participant "PaymentService\n(deposit confirm)" as Pay
participant "ContractService" as Svc
participant "OutboxPublisher" as Outbox
participant "Outbox Worker" as Worker
participant "PdfService" as Pdf
participant "EmailService" as Email
participant "NotificationService" as Notif
database "Database" as DB

note over Pay, Outbox
  FR-10: Contract is NEVER generated on-demand.
  It is enqueued in the same TX as deposit confirmation
  and processed asynchronously by the Outbox worker.
end note

== Step 1 — Deposit Confirmed (Trigger) ==
Pay -> Svc: autoGenerateAndSendContract(bookingId, actor)
activate Svc
Svc -> Outbox: enqueueContractGenerate(bookingId, actorId)
note right: Same DB transaction as payment confirm.\nOutbox entry persisted atomically.
Outbox -> DB: INSERT outbox_events (CONTRACT_GENERATE, bookingId)
Svc --> Pay: return (fire-and-forget)
deactivate Svc

== Step 2 — Outbox Worker: Generate Contract + PDF ==
Worker -> Svc: processContractGenerateFromOutbox(bookingId, actor)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: findById(bookingId)
activate DB
DB --> Svc: Booking
deactivate DB

alt booking.status in [PENDING_DEPOSIT, CANCELLED, NO_SHOW]
    Svc --> Worker: throw IllegalArgumentException\n"Booking chưa đủ điều kiện sinh hợp đồng"
else booking is eligible (CONFIRMED+)
    ' Idempotent create
    Svc -> DB: findByBookingId(bookingId)
    activate DB
    DB --> Svc: Optional<Contract>
    deactivate DB

    alt contract not exists
        Svc -> DB: INSERT contracts (customer, room, dates, amounts, status=ACTIVE)
        activate DB
        DB --> Svc: Contract (id assigned)
        deactivate DB
        Svc -> Notif: sendNotification(customerId, CONTRACT_GENERATED, ...)
    end

    alt contract.pdfUrl is null
        Svc -> Pdf: generateContractPdf(contract)
        activate Pdf
        Pdf --> Svc: byte[] pdfBytes
        deactivate Pdf
        Svc -> Svc: validate size <= 10MB
        Svc -> Svc: Files.write(uploads/contracts/{id}.pdf)
        Svc -> DB: UPDATE contracts SET pdf_url = '/uploads/contracts/{id}.pdf'
        Svc -> DB: activityLogService.log(CONTRACT_GENERATED)
    end

    Svc -> Outbox: enqueueContractEmailSend(contractId, actorId)
    Outbox -> DB: INSERT outbox_events (CONTRACT_EMAIL_SEND, contractId)
end
deactivate Svc

== Step 3 — Outbox Worker: Send Email ==
Worker -> Svc: processContractEmailSendFromOutbox(contractId, targetEmail, actor)
activate Svc
Svc -> DB: findById(contractId) → Contract
Svc -> Svc: loadStoredPdfStrict(contract)
note right: Reads pdf from disk.\nFails if file missing — never regenerates.
Svc -> Email: sendEmailWithAttachment(customerEmail, subject, body, pdfBytes)
activate Email
Email --> Svc: void
deactivate Email
Svc -> DB: UPDATE contracts SET sent_at = NOW()
Svc -> DB: activityLogService.log(CONTRACT_EMAIL_SENT)
Svc --> Worker: void
deactivate Svc
@enduml
